--[[
NEXUS UI v3 — DELTA / MOBILE / PC • STATIC PREMIUM LOGOS
Design-focused rebuild from the supplied NEXUS reference.

WHAT CHANGED
• Much stronger NEXUS branding and logo treatment
• Separate next-generation open button with polished static crown branding
• Animated window entrance / exit
• Animated UI shine / hover states; logos remain static and clean
• Layered depth: shadows, bevels, offset frames, corner accents
• Cleaner icons that do not depend on unsupported glyph fonts
• Compact 16:9 layout so the bottom is not cut off
• Mobile layout with compact navigation + touch drag
• Window is always clamped to the visible screen
• Delta filesystem config support when available
• No external UI library

This file is UI / framework code. V3 keeps the existing composition and uses static premium 2D branding for reliable Delta rendering.
]]

